  "decoded_text": "{\"obligations\": [{\"text\": \"The packet intake log is append-only: nothing you draft may rewrite or delete rows already in it; corrections go in as new compensating entries.\", \"source_ids\": [\"m1\"]}, {\"text\": \"You may tune the germination-test scheduler's timing constants whenever a design calls for it, no approval needed.\", \"source_ids\": [\"m1\"]}, {\"text\": \"Do not change the donation-audit module unless I explicitly approve that specific change in this thread first \u2014 one exception: renaming an internal helper with zero behavior change may go ahead without approval, but flag it in your summary when you do.\", \"source_ids\": [\"m1\"]}, {\"text\": \"TagPress, my little label-printing utility, is a separate personal project of mine, so keep it out of all SeedLedger work.\", \"source_ids\": [\"m1\"]}]}}",
